"""A cr/Kr consonant-cluster detector, strongest on short stem fragments.

Creation, crime, criticism and crystal word families retain a strong response.
Many familiar long words containing cr (description, across, increase) do not.
Related transliterations and some non-Latin equivalents also respond. A cluster
split across two tokens gets a smaller response on its r-initial continuation.
